[[File:LG-prerelease-Heroes of Skyrim Title.jpg|thumb|right|Heroes of Skyrim]]
'''Heroes of Skyrim''' is the first card [[LG:expansions|expansion]] for [[Legends:Legends|Legends]]. It introduces new [[Legends:Packs|card packs]] separate from the [[LG:Core Set|Core Set]], which can be opened to earn 154 new cards themed after [[Skyrim:Skyrim|''The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim'']]. The cards feature dragons, Shouts, the Companions, the College of Winterhold, the Civil War, and more. The expansion was released on June 28, 2017, a day earlier than announced.

Upon logging in, players are given a [[Legends:Deck Packs|deck pack]] containing a [[Legends:Theme Decks|theme deck]] from the expansion. Playmat art and music have also been added, and the game's icon changed to a new image featuring the Dragonborn.

Dragon cards are spread over all [[Legends:Attributes|attributes]] and reward being played together. New [[Legends:Shouts|shout]] [[Legends:Actions|actions]] upgrade other copies of themselves in decks, and Companion cards use the Beast Form ability to change into more powerful Lycanthropes.

