==Notes==
* The Legendary Card Pack for Heroes of Skyrim contains words in the [[Lore:Dragon Alphabet|Dragon alphabet]] on it.  The circle around the logo in the center reads "WALK IN THE PATH OF THE LEGENDS" (only "PA" is visible, with the "TH" covered, but the full line appears in assets in the game files), and the text around the outside reads "UNLEASH THE STRENGTH OF LEGENDS AND CONQUER ALL" (giving us the first example of a C in the Dragon alphabet) and "THE POWER OF LEGENDS AWAITS YOU".
*Heroes of Skyrim cards were added to ''[[Legends:Legends Asia|Legends Asia]]'' in July 2020.

